sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser + smart card
  box Gateway boundary - SIMULATED
    participant G as Trusted gateway
  end
  box Application - IMPLEMENTED
    participant A as App: provenance, sessions
  end
  participant S as Session store (in-memory today, PLANNED: durable)
  participant L as Audit sink (PLANNED)

  B->>G: TLS handshake with client certificate
  G->>G: Validate chain, key usage, client-auth EKU, validity
  G->>G: Check signed CRL (unknown or stale means deny)
  alt certificate rejected
    G-->>B: 401 (the request never reaches the app)
  else certificate accepted
    G->>A: Request + identity headers (stripped and re-added by the gateway)
    A->>A: Verify provenance BEFORE reading any identity header
    alt provenance not proven
      A->>L: audit: spoof attempt (redacted)
      A-->>B: 401
    else provenance proven
      A->>S: Create session (id, CSRF token, idle + absolute expiry)
      A-->>B: Set-Cookie HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite + CSRF token
    end
  end

  Note over B,A: Later requests
  B->>A: Request with session cookie
  A->>S: Validate, slide idle window, reissue cookie
  B->>A: Logout with CSRF token
  A->>S: Revoke session
  B->>A: Replay of the old cookie
  A-->>B: 401 (revoked)
